Kero309x Bot Audit — NOTICE
===========================

1. Independence
---------------

Kero309x Bot Audit is an independent audit of a privately operated WhatsApp
bot. It is not a fork, mirror or rebranding of that bot, and it contains no
source code taken from it.

What this repository publishes is:

  - analysis written from reading the audited source;
  - proof scripts that execute that source and print observed values;
  - captured output of those scripts;
  - screenshots captured from a synthetic sandbox environment.

The audited bot is the work of its own owner. Nothing in this repository
changes its licence, and no part of it is redistributed here.

