3. Customer data
-----------------

The audited system stores real customer data. This repository publishes
pseudonymised identifiers only, as described in docs/decisions/0002-redaction.md.
Receipt images, chat message bodies and payment message text are not
published. Screenshots come from the audited system's own synthetic sandbox
environment.

The mapping between a pseudonym and a person exists only in the private
database of the audited system's owner. The pseudonyms are a re-identification
defence against casual reading and bulk scraping; they are not a claim of
anonymity, and they are not intended to withstand a determined adversary who
holds the database.

